  dialogueLines:
  - Pssst... Did you find both my chests?
  - Good mages like you can make excellent use of my health and morale potions.
  - Although, one of them is guarded by a goblin. Howver, you don't need to engage
    them. You can sneak around if able. They are pretty dumb.
